[1] functions.bash (timeout: 20s)
command:
pwd; ls -la; rg --files -g 'AGENTS.md' -g '*README*' -g '*EXECUTION*' -g '*DEPENDENCIES*' -g '*design*' -g '*设计*' -g '.gitmodules' -g '.gitignore'
output:
wsl: An error occurred mounting the distribution disk, it was mounted read-only as a fallback.
wsl: See recovery instructions on: https://aka.ms/wsldiskmountrecovery
<3>WSL (10 - Relay) ERROR: CreateProcessCommon:800: execvpe(/bin/bash) failed: No such file or directory
